  "code" : "public int connectSticks(int[] sticks) {\n    PriorityQueue<Integer> heap = new PriorityQueue<>();\n    for (int s : sticks) heap.add(s);\n\n    int totalCost = 0;\n    while (heap.size() > 1) {\n        int a = heap.poll();\n        int b = heap.poll();\n        int cost = a + b;\n        totalCost += cost;\n        heap.add(cost);\n    }\n    return totalCost;\n}",
